{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33405","headline":"送人入新罗使 · 李昌符","name":"送人入新罗使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸡林君欲去，立册付星轺。\n越海程难计，征帆影自飘。\n望乡当落日，怀阙羡回潮。\n宿雾蒙青嶂，惊波荡碧霄。\n春生阳气早，天接祖州遥。\n愁约三年外，相迎上石桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昌符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}